* 03_analysis.do: models, tables, and figures
*
* master.do runs this step after 02_clean.do.
{{- if .Sensitive}}
* Tables and figures go to private folders first. Move one to a public folder
* only after checking it for small cells and identifying details.
{{- end}}

* use `"{{.Final}}/analysis.dta"', clear
* regress outcome exposure
* putexcel set `"{{.Tables}}/table1.xlsx"', replace
* graph export `"{{.Figures}}/figure1.png"', replace
